                <mxCell id="e_m8m10" style="edgeStyle=none;endArrow=classic;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0" parent="1" source="m8" target="m10" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="legend" value="Plan flow: one plan from feature request to merge-ready branch. /full-cycle is single-pass by default - the planner brainstorms, specs, plans, then DISPATCHES the orchestrator subagent in the same run and relays its report (no approval gates). The handoff keyword opts out: the planner prints the /execute-plan line for a fresh session instead.&#xa;&#xa;Shapes:&#xa;- ellipse = start / stop&#xa;- rectangle = process / action&#xa;- rhombus = decision (Yes / No labeled on each branch)&#xa;- parallelogram = artifact written to disk&#xa;&#xa;Agents:&#xa;- PRIMARY (drives a phase): planner = phase 1 (dispatches the orchestrator at the end, single-pass); orchestrator = phase 2 (standalone /execute-plan OR planner-dispatched; never edits directly).&#xa;- SUBAGENT (dispatched, one job each): executor = implements 1 task; reviewer = spec + quality; oracle = read-only consult after 2 strikes; standardizer = merged audit pass after the task loop (repo structure: kebab-case, AGENTS, docs/artifacts, catalogs; code structure: formatter/linter config, per-language rules, architecture boundaries); documenter = execution report + catalog updates after structure review; explore = codebase recon.&#xa;&#xa;Rules: planner writes only docs/; orchestrator edit/write/patch denied so every change flows through an executor; a two-strike failure (verify or review rejected twice) escalates to the oracle, whose recommendation is folded into the next executor dispatch; commits land at task boundaries (plan-execution carve-out); single-pass needs subagent_depth &gt;= 2 so the orchestrator can dispatch executor/reviewer - without it, fall back to the handoff; no merge or PR unless the user asks.&#xa;- standardizer loads both project-standardization and code-standardization; one audit pass covers repo + code.&#xa;&#xa;Sources: docs/workflows/workflow.md; commands/full-cycle.md, execute-plan.md, goal.md; agents/{planner,orchestrator,executor,reviewer,oracle,standardizer,documenter}.md; skills/code-standardization/SKILL.md" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="860" y="120" width="500" height="400" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>